# HANDOFF.md IS TRACKED ON PURPOSE as of 2026-09-11. Do not re-ignore it.
#
# It was ignored here from f4fa44a, which meant it never appeared in
# `git status`, nothing could ever contradict it, and it drifted for three
# weeks asserting -- in three separate places -- that ~/.config/nvim was not a
# git repository at all. By then this repo had a public remote and pushed
# history, so a reader could have concluded their edits were unrecoverable, or
# run `git init` over it.
#
# Tracking it is the only mechanism that makes that kind of staleness visible.
# Scanned before tracking: no client names, no credentials. THIS REMOTE IS
# PUBLIC, so scan again before adding anything sensitive to it.
